Google <a href="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/student-offer-google-ai/">today said</a> eligible college students in the United States can get a free year of Google AI Pro. Google AI Pro is normally priced at &#36;19.99 per month, and it includes 4x higher usage limits in Gemini, access to Gemini Spark, Gemini in Google apps like Gmail and Google Docs, and 5TB of storage space.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/08/google-ai-student-discount.jpg" alt="" width="2000" height="1125" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1060220" /><br/>
Eligible college students outside the United States can get a free year of Google AI Plus, which includes Gemini Omni, 4x higher usage limits in Gemini, and 400GB storage.<br/>
<br/>
College students can also opt for a Google AI Pro and YouTube Premium bundle for &#36;8.99 per month in the United States, which is a 70 percent discount off the regular price. Students can subscribe to the YouTube Premium bundle for up to four years, and verification through SheerID is required.<br/>
<br/>
Google added a student hub to Gemini with study notebooks, diagnostic quizzes, and study plans. Gemini Notebook is available in AI Mode in Search, and a dedicated notebook can be set up for each project or class. Notebooks from Gemini Notebook or the Gemini app will appear automatically in Search. Notebooks for AI Mode are rolling out to over 180 countries in the coming days.<br/>
<br/>
Google Search can generate custom tools and simulations for complicated concepts, along with practice quizzes for the ACT, AP, ENEM, GRE, JEE, LSAT, MCAT, NEET, and SAT. Generative UIs are available globally in AI Mode and are rolling out to AI Overviews over the coming weeks, while the practice quiz option is available now.<br/>
<br/>
Lens in Search will soon include an interactive learning experience for breaking down tough problems. Students can use the Google app to take a photo of what they're working on to get an AI Overview that can find mistakes and offer explanations.<br/>
<br/>
Students can sign up for a free AI plan <a href="https://one.google.com/ai-student?g1_landing_page=75">on Google's website</a> through December 31, 2026. After the free subscription period, Google will charge &#36;19.99 per month for AI Pro unless the plan is canceled, and &#36;4.99 per month (or the local currency equivalent) for AI Plus.<br/>
<br/>
